# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/).

## [2.0.0] - 2026-11-18

### Added

- Verification of auto-renewed validator transactions (AddAutoRenewedValidatorTx and SetAutoRenewedValidatorConfigTx) with the transaction types addAutoRenewedValidatorP, updateAutoRenewedValidatorP and removeAutoRenewedValidatorP, and the staking parameters period, validatorAuthority and validatorTxId.
- Warning constants exported in the namespace warning.
- Warnings ANYONE_CAN_SPEND, ANY_OWNER_CAN_SPEND and MULTIPLE_OWNERS_REQUIRED for transaction outputs that specify no owner, multiple owners any one of whom can spend them, and multiple owners several of whom must sign.
- Warning REWARDS_NOT_TO_STAKE_OWNER when staking rewards will be assigned to the owner of the first input, which is not the stake owner.
- Warnings VALIDATOR_AUTHORITY_NOT_TO_STAKE_OWNER and VALIDATOR_NOT_FOUND for auto-renewed validators.
- Warnings SAFE_DELEGATE_CALL and SAFE_GAS_REFUND for Safe transactions that make a delegate call or pay a gas refund to another address.
- Warning CONTRACT_CALL_NOT_DECODED when a contract call cannot be decoded.

### Changed

- Transaction type constants and the functions isKnownType and getDescription are exported in the namespace txtype instead of at the package root.
- The package exports only its main entry point; imports of internal files are no longer possible.
- Node.js 24 or later is required.
- Upgraded @flarenetwork/flarejs to version 5.2.0.
- Contract calls whose arguments cannot be decoded return a verification with the warning CONTRACT_CALL_NOT_DECODED instead of null.
- P-chain and atomic transactions followed by additional bytes return null; transactions are accepted unsigned or signed.
- GZIP input larger than 1 MB after decompression returns null.
- Network requests time out after 10 seconds.
- Invalid entries in the lists of Flare contracts are skipped.
- Node.js Buffer is no longer used.
- Contract registry update.
- Dependency updates.

### Removed

- Warning MULTIPLE_SIGNERS ("One or more transaction outputs specify multiple signers."), replaced by ANYONE_CAN_SPEND, ANY_OWNER_CAN_SPEND and MULTIPLE_OWNERS_REQUIRED, and no longer returned for the validator authority.

### Fixed

- Export from P-chain to outputs with multiple owners or no owner returned null.
- P-chain transactions with outputs that specify no owner returned null.
- False warnings for addresses with more than 1024 UTXOs.
- Proxy implementation addresses starting with a zero byte were not resolved.
- False warning for imports to P-chain that spend P-chain funds.
- An unreachable C-chain node caused indefinite connection retries after verification.

## [1.4.0] - 2026-01-15

### Added

- Decoding of Safe transactions.

### Changed

- Flare asset repository update.
- Contract registry update.
- Dependency updates.


## [1.3.1] - 2025-06-24

### Added

- Verification of transfer transactions on the P-chain

### Changed

- Delegation fee in percentages for backward compatibility.

### Removed

- Warning when node id in staking transaction is unknown.

## [1.3.0] - 2025-06-05

### Added

- Decoding of stake transactions (AddPermissionlessDelegator and AddPermissionlessValidator).

### Changed

- Contract registry update.
- Dependency update.

## [1.2.0] - 2024-11-07

### Added

- Contract proxy detection and decoding.

### Changed

- Flare network contract identification.
- Contract registry update.
- Dependency update.

## [1.1.0] - 2024-08-09

### Changed

- Updated network ids.

## [1.0.7] - 2024-07-23

### Added

- Contract method ABI for EVM transactions.

## [1.0.6] - 2024-04-12

### Changed

- Checksummed recipient address for EVM transactions.

### Fixed

- EVM transaction type definition for transactions with zero data.
- Handling of unknown network.

## [1.0.5] - 2024-02-23

### Added

- Tests.

## [1.0.4] - 2024-02-22

### Added

- Support for base64 encoded inputs.
- Support for GZIP compressioned inputs.

## [1.0.3] - 2024-02-15

### Removed

- Warning when transaction fee is not set.

## [1.0.2] - 2024-02-12

### Added

- Transaction types exposed.

## [1.0.1] - 2024-02-08

### Added

- Contract data acquisition for unkown networks.

## [1.0.0] - 2024-01-20

### Added

- Initial version.